  "description": "All existing single glazed timber casements, vertical sliding sash windows and doors on the front elevation of Grove Mansions, ground to 4th floor are proposed to be replaced with new slim-line Heritage style double glazed timber casements, vertical sliding sash windows and doors. All windows to be white, and sash windows to have run through sash horns, to match existing.\n\nAll existing single glazed timber casements and vertical sliding sash windows and  doors on the rear elevation of Grove Mansions, ground to 3rd floor are proposed to be replaced with new double glazed uPVC casements and vertical sliding sash windows and doors. All windows to be white and sash windows to have run through sash horns, to match existing.\n\n",
